<!--
    Kay Chart splash.

    The background colour and the launch behaviour are unchanged from the
    previous splash, so the Android startup fix (render-first, then native
    plugins) is not disturbed. Only the artwork changes: the Kay Chart mark,
    centred with the wordmark-style bar beneath it.
-->
